      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Karposh Point (Bulgarian: \"нос Карпош\" , ‘Nos Karposh’ \\'nos 'kar-posh\\) is the ice-free point on the north coast of Snow Island in the South Shetland Islands, Antarctica. It is projecting 500 m into Morton Strait, and is situated 2.3 km west of the extreme northeast point of President Head, 2.5 km east-southeast of Gostun Point, and 4.8 km east-southeast of Cape Timblón.",
